# Walkthrough: Rigorous Endpoint Testing & Bug Fixes

## Summary
Rigorously tested **all 15 endpoints** in `realtime_groups` against **real Supabase** with real users. Found and fixed **7 bugs** across 4 router files + 2 test files. Created a 30-test live integration suite — **all 30 pass**.

## Bugs Found & Fixed

### 1. `conftest.py` — Wrong path calculation (ROOT CAUSE of all previous test failures)
`Path(__file__).parents[4]` → fixed to `parents[3]`. This was why all 10 existing tests failed with `ModuleNotFoundError`.

### 2. `arena_router.py` — 3 unhandled `.single()` exceptions
Supabase's `.single()` **throws an exception** when 0 rows match (PostgREST behavior). The code checked `if not resp.data` but never reached it because the exception propagated as a bare `500 Internal Server Error`.

**Fixed in 3 places:**
- `publish_idea` — validation lookup + post insert
- `get_post` — post detail lookup  
- `vote_on_poll` — poll lookup
- `vote_on_post` — author lookup for karma reward

### 3. `community_router.py` — Unhandled `.single()` in `get_hub`
Same `.single()` crash pattern. Now returns proper `404`.

### 4. `profile_router.py` — `get_profile` returned 500 instead of 404
The exception handler re-raised as `500_INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR`. Changed to `404_NOT_FOUND`.

### 5. `test_god_mode_e2e.py` — 3 payload/URL bugs
- Poll votes sent `{"option_index": 0}` instead of `{"poll_id": "...", "option_id": "..."}`
- Synthesis URL was `/api/v1/synthesis/threads/{id}` instead of `/api/v1/arena/posts/{id}/synthesize`
- Response assertion checked `"insights"` instead of `"summary"`

